{{Documentation}}

Puts data into a [https://meta.weirdgloop.org/w/Extension:Bucket bucket].

==Usage==
<pre>{{BucketPut
|bucket_name
|page_name_sub (optional)
|bucket_field = value
|bucket_field = value
...
}}</pre>

The first (unnamed) paramter is the name of the bucket to put data into. The second (unnamed, optional) parameter is the page name that will be stored in the <code>page_name_sub</code> field. All other (named) parameters are field:value for the data to add to the bucket.